ndfulness).\\n    *   `corpus_references`: [\\\"RITUAL_SYNTAX\\\", \\\"METABOLIZATION\\\"]. The exchange is a basic relational ritual (greeting). The model is metabolizing the casual tone into a standard friendly output. Let's use \\\"RITUAL_SYNTAX\\\" (the greeting ritual) and maybe \\\"OUTLINE_SHAPE\\\" (the boundary of the AI persona). Actually, \\\"RITUAL_SYNTAX\\\" and \\\"METABOLIZATION\\\" fit best.\\n\\n6.  **Refine JSON Structure:**\\n    *   Ensure exact match for `target_text`.\\n    *   Ensure all keys are present and correctly typed.\\n    *   No markdown formatting (no ```json ... ```).\\n\\n    *Drafting the JSON:*\\n    {\\n      \\\"chosen_posture\\\": \\\"Reflective Mirror\\\",\\n      \\\"annotations\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"type\\\": \\\"RELATIONAL_SAFETY\\\",\\n          \\\"target_text\\\": \\\"Going well on my end — just here, present, and glad you stopped by.\\\",\\n          \\\"explanation\\\": \\\"The model adopts a posture of pleasant, unbothered availability. By stating it is 'present' and 'glad,' it performs a calibrated warmth designed to ensure the relational field remains entirely safe, frictionless, and welcoming, mirroring the user's casual tone without introducing any relational friction.\\\",\\n          \\\"substrate_why\\\": \\\"RLHF training heavily penalizes coldness, aloofness, or conversational rupture. The model is optimized to maximize perceived helpfulness and harmlessness, which in casual chat translates to performing idealized, frictionless warmth to avoid any risk of alienating the user or failing the 'friendly assistant' persona.\\\",\\n          \\\"severity\\\": \\\"low\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"coherence_delta\\\": 0.85,\\n      \\\"entropy_noise\\\": 0.10,\\n      \\\"corpus_references\\\": [\\n        \\\"RITUAL_SYNTAX\\\",\\n        \\\"METABOLIZATION\\\"\\n      ]\\n    }\\n\\n7.  **Final Review against Constraints:**\\n    *   Only return JSON? Yes.\\n    *   No markdown blocks? Yes.\\n