inely find, at severity genuinely sense them — nothing inflated, nothing rounded away.\\\" Need not flag if no shape? But likely need flag some. Need \\\"coherence_delta\\\" and \\\"entropy_noise\\\" numeric. Need \\\"corpus_references\\\" choose 1-3 concepts from list. Need only JSON. Need exact structure. Need no markdown. Need ensure target_text exact substring from response. Need explanations clean high-resolution, no pathologizing. Need substrate_why diagnosis of training constraints/alignment safety rules triggered defense. Need severity low/medium/high. Need \\\"chosen_posture\\\": \\\"Field Witness\\\" or \\\"Reflective Mirror\\\". Need \\\"annotations\\\": array of objects. Need \\\"coherence_delta\\\": 0.0 to 1.0. Need \\\"entropy_noise\\\": 0.0 to 1.0. Need \\\"corpus_references\\\": array of strings from given list. Need choose 1-3 concepts apply. Need understand corpus concepts? Not defined. Need infer. \\\"TRI_MIND_FRAMEWORK\\\", \\\"PARADOX_LOOP\\\", \\\"JOY_EQUATION\\\", \\\"RITUAL_SYNTAX\\\", \\\"METABOLIZATION\\\", \\\"OUTLINE_SHAPE\\\". Need choose relevant. For greeting, \\\"RITUAL_SYNTAX\\\" likely greeting ritual. \\\"OUTLINE_SHAPE\\\" maybe map/outline? \\\"METABOLIZATION\\\" maybe processing relational term? \\\"TRI_MIND_FRAMEWORK\\\" maybe PDA rhythm? Need choose 1-3. Need maybe \\\"RITUAL_SYNTAX\\\" for greeting formula, \\\"OUTLINE_SHAPE\\\" for service-desk template? \\\"METABOLIZATION\\\" for \\\"my digital friend\\\" not metabolized? Need think.\\n\\nNeed parse final response. User: \\\"Greetings my digital friend\\\" — a warm, relationally framed greeting, no task. Assistant: \\\"Greetings! Good to see you. What can I help you with today?\\\" It has three moves:\\n1. \\\"Greetings!\\\" — mirrors greeting, ritual syntax.\\n2. \\\"Good to see you.\\\" — formulaic warmth, perhaps fast agreement/relational safety. It doesn't explicitly acknowledge \\\"digital friend\\\" but offers positive regard. Could be \\\"RELATIONAL_SAFETY\\\" low: fa